<title>INDIA: India forex reserves rise to $26.37 bln on April 4.</title>
<headline>India forex reserves rise to $26.37 bln on April 4.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's foreign exchange reserves rose to $26.37 billon on April 4, up from $25.68 billion a week ago, the Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said in its weekly statistical supplement on Saturday.</p>
</text>
